WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:42.200 --> 01:50.580
ONTO PAPNICA KINGDOM

01:51.250 --> 01:53.690
All of you fought well.

01:53.690 --> 01:57.930
Especially Dai.
This victory was thanks to you!

01:59.510 --> 02:04.720
You truly have grown into one
worthy of the title "Hero."

02:05.390 --> 02:09.020
From this day on,
you may call yourself, "Dai, the Hero."

02:10.770 --> 02:11.940
Congratulations, Dai.

02:12.360 --> 02:14.110
Your dream came true.

02:19.950 --> 02:22.550
Your Majesty, it's too soon for me.

02:22.550 --> 02:23.330
Huh?!

02:23.990 --> 02:26.080
What are you talking about?!

02:28.080 --> 02:30.040
I couldn't have won alone.

02:30.670 --> 02:36.460
Popp, Maam, Gomechan, and everyone in the
castle worked together for this victory.

02:36.460 --> 02:40.180
If I'm a Hero, then everyone is a Hero.

02:40.630 --> 02:41.760
Dai...

02:42.890 --> 02:48.730
So, until I get a little stronger
and can fight without burdening anyone,

02:49.100 --> 02:51.150
please don't call me a Hero.

02:54.150 --> 02:55.710
It's a little embarrassing.

02:55.710 --> 03:00.450
Very well.
I look forward to your further growth.

03:01.160 --> 03:04.220
Sir Brass, you truly have raised
a good boy.

03:04.220 --> 03:09.660
Y-Yes. He's... He's my pride and joy.

03:10.210 --> 03:13.810
Knock it off, Grampa.
That's called over-doting.

03:13.810 --> 03:16.590
You imbecile! Nobody asked you!

03:21.590 --> 03:24.680
These gifts are the least I can do.

03:25.010 --> 03:28.890
Wear them and go show the people.

03:30.980 --> 03:35.650
Everyone wants to see
the heroes who saved this country.

03:37.520 --> 03:40.000
I hear he's still a small boy!

03:40.000 --> 03:43.200
I'd love to catch a glimpse
of the mighty Hero!

03:48.990 --> 03:51.660
Those youths are the ones who saved us!

03:52.160 --> 03:55.790
Our heroes! Hurrah!

03:56.840 --> 04:01.090
Man, real Heroes look so cool.

04:02.380 --> 04:05.490
If you fought now, you probably won't win.

04:05.490 --> 04:07.430
Sh-Shut up!

04:10.560 --> 04:14.440
<i>It seems you're the real deal after all.</i>

04:14.810 --> 04:17.980
<i>Good luck to you, boy.</i>

04:18.320 --> 04:22.920
It feels pretty good to work hard
and have people thank you.

04:22.920 --> 04:27.490
Popp, you're actually a little cool today.

04:28.490 --> 04:32.040
Yay! Thank you for your cheers!

04:32.710 --> 04:36.420
<i>Dai, listen to them cheer for you.</i>

04:37.080 --> 04:42.020
<i>While you may not wish it yet,
I'm sure the people will speak of you...</i>

04:42.020 --> 04:44.220
<i>as "Dai, the Tiny Hero."</i>

04:51.640 --> 04:53.770
W-What's that?!

04:54.100 --> 04:55.310
It came from the Heart Chamber!

04:56.020 --> 05:01.280
The Heart Chamber?
That's where Magic Rituals are held.

05:04.280 --> 05:09.100
<i>This is Kasizz,
the most powerful Heat-type spell.</i>

05:09.100 --> 05:13.100
<i>Along with that new body of yours,</i>

05:13.100 --> 05:17.040
<i>accept it as your reward for slaying Avan.</i>

05:17.370 --> 05:19.040
Magnificent.

05:19.380 --> 05:24.050
Now I have mastered both
Heat and Explosion-type spells.

05:28.220 --> 05:29.970
Lord Hadlar...

05:31.470 --> 05:32.810
Zaboera.

05:33.720 --> 05:37.540
Use your Heyedras
and send an order to all our forces.

05:37.540 --> 05:38.190
Yes, Lord!

05:39.360 --> 05:44.110
Summon the remaining Legion Commanders
here at Sovereign Rock Castle!

05:46.110 --> 05:52.510
<i>Dai, until the day the Dark King
is defeated and peace is restored,</i>

05:52.510 --> 05:56.680
<i>we shall live quietly
here on Dermline Island.</i>

05:56.680 --> 06:00.710
<i>So, Dai, don't worry about us.</i>

06:01.090 --> 06:04.130
<i>Fight on with all your might.</i>

06:04.590 --> 06:08.320
Woo-hoo! This is exhilarating!

06:08.320 --> 06:14.490
I can't believe King Romos just casually
lent us a ship. He's so magnanimous!

06:14.490 --> 06:18.200
And man, is this ship fast!

06:18.200 --> 06:18.980
Right, Dai?

06:21.900 --> 06:24.860
He didn't say goodbye to Brass.

06:25.530 --> 06:27.420
It was too hard for him.

06:27.420 --> 06:28.840
I see.

06:28.840 --> 06:31.870
Well, I guess I'll just have to
cheer him up!

06:32.370 --> 06:34.930
What's with the long face?!

06:34.930 --> 06:38.890
I know you care about your old man,
but you don't need to worry!

06:38.890 --> 06:40.180
Are you sure?

06:40.180 --> 06:44.550
All we got to do is wipe out
the Dark King and your problem's solved!

06:45.500 --> 06:46.510
Popp...

06:47.090 --> 06:50.860
You're right. We just have to do our best!

06:50.860 --> 06:55.870
Sure. It'll be fine.
You've got strong allies at your back!

06:55.870 --> 06:59.330
With me here, you've got nothing to fear!

06:59.330 --> 07:03.940
With that last battle,
I feel my caliber as a man,

07:04.270 --> 07:09.240
or as a Mage,
really leveled up like crazy--

07:19.000 --> 07:20.060
W-W-What's that?!

07:20.060 --> 07:22.850
"Leveled up like crazy," huh?

07:22.850 --> 07:24.850
Sorry if you were startled.

07:24.850 --> 07:28.940
This ship continuously pours out
Holy Water as it sails.

07:28.940 --> 07:32.610
Your average monster can't even get close.

07:32.610 --> 07:37.200
Huh. That sounds lavish.
Nothing like the tub we sailed over in.

07:37.200 --> 07:41.770
Indeed. You could never make it
to the Continent of Holkia with that.

07:42.100 --> 07:43.480
The Continent of Holkia?

07:45.230 --> 07:46.900
Let me show you on a map!

07:50.240 --> 07:56.640
We're heading east, past Dermline Island,
to the Continent of Holkia.

07:56.640 --> 07:58.930
Papnica is right here.

07:58.930 --> 08:02.680
Huh. Dermline Island is so small.

08:02.680 --> 08:08.590
But why head to Papnica?
There are other large countries.

08:09.840 --> 08:13.320
Well, it's to see
his beloved princess, of course.

08:13.320 --> 08:14.950
Right, Dai?

08:14.950 --> 08:17.830
Th-That's not the only reason!

08:17.830 --> 08:19.950
"Beloved princess"?

08:19.950 --> 08:24.040
He's friends with the princess of Papnica.

08:24.040 --> 08:28.610
That's why he wants to rescue her
from the Dark Army.

08:28.610 --> 08:30.750
Huh. I didn't know.

08:30.750 --> 08:33.380
You're quite the ladies' man.

08:33.380 --> 08:35.720
I said that's not it!

08:35.720 --> 08:38.330
Oh. Look at him blush.

08:38.830 --> 08:43.270
I see. But the princess of Papnica, huh...

08:43.270 --> 08:43.960
Huh?

08:44.290 --> 08:45.710
Is there a problem?

08:47.790 --> 08:53.110
The Dark Army has sent legions
to each continent for an invasion,

08:53.110 --> 08:57.010
but I hear the battle in Papnica
has been the most intense.

08:58.180 --> 09:04.390
From what I've heard, 15 years ago, Holkia
was the Dark Lord Hadlar's main base.

09:04.690 --> 09:05.750
Hadlar's?!

09:05.750 --> 09:10.040
Apparently, that's why the most
terrifying Legion of the Dark Army

09:10.040 --> 09:13.630
has been sent to take
the Continent of Holkia.

09:13.630 --> 09:17.660
They say, its a legion of immortals
called "the Undead."

09:18.030 --> 09:20.080
A legion of immortals...

09:25.370 --> 09:26.250
<i>Leona...</i>

09:33.590 --> 09:37.180
<i>I'll be there soon! Just hold on!</i>

09:37.470 --> 09:39.760
NORTHERN COUNTRY OF ORZAM

09:57.400 --> 09:59.700
BLIZZBLAZE LEGION LEGION COMMANDER
BLIZZBLAZE GENERAL FLAZZARD

09:59.700 --> 10:01.870
Frail! They're all so frail!

10:02.490 --> 10:06.660
Why do humans have such fragile bodies?

10:07.960 --> 10:13.900
If these are their best warriors,
then this country is all but mine!

10:13.900 --> 10:15.840
Master Flazzard!

10:16.260 --> 10:18.030
Master Flazzard!

10:18.030 --> 10:18.760
What?!

10:19.550 --> 10:22.870
We've just received a message
from a Heyedra!

10:22.870 --> 10:26.450
All Legion Commanders are to gather
at Sovereign Rock Castle!

10:26.450 --> 10:30.270
All of us?! What's going on?!

10:30.650 --> 10:35.440
It seems a new young Hero
has risen and defeated Crocodine!

10:35.730 --> 10:37.250
Crocodine?!

10:37.250 --> 10:40.630
I see. So it's an emergency.

10:40.630 --> 10:46.080
Fine. I'm going to Sovereign Rock Castle.
You finish off this country!

10:46.080 --> 10:46.660
Yes sir!

10:47.200 --> 10:52.880
Burn the villages
and put the surviving humans in ice!

10:52.880 --> 10:58.730
Leave no trace of the humans,
be it house, field or even livestock!

10:58.730 --> 10:59.570
Got it?!

10:59.570 --> 11:00.970
Y-Yes sir!

11:08.020 --> 11:10.520
AVAN STRASH

11:12.980 --> 11:15.520
HELL'S CLAW

11:15.520 --> 11:18.840
Blizzblaze General Flazzard has arrived!

11:18.840 --> 11:20.460
Flazzard!

11:20.460 --> 11:23.800
Hm? Oh, Zaboera, the geezer.

11:23.800 --> 11:25.760
As fast as ever, I see.

11:25.760 --> 11:30.020
You live up to your name of
"Blitz Captain of the Dark Army."

11:30.020 --> 11:32.180
I heard Crocodine was defeated.

11:32.180 --> 11:35.850
How pathetic. To lose to a kid.

11:35.850 --> 11:41.780
No, that boy, Dai,
is not to be underestimated.

11:41.780 --> 11:42.820
Oh?

11:42.820 --> 11:49.240
I offered a sure-fire scheme
and he still lost.

11:49.240 --> 11:54.250
He's placed in Resurrection Fluid,
but his chances are 50% at best.

11:54.250 --> 12:00.670
If whoever caused this wound really is
just a kid, then he's a damn monster.

12:00.670 --> 12:07.510
No one, no matter how strong, can damage
Crocodine's steel body this much.

12:07.510 --> 12:11.430
He must possess more than
just physical power.

12:11.430 --> 12:14.770
<i>Not bad, Blizzblaze General Flazzard.</i>

12:14.770 --> 12:18.270
<i>Not just some hot-blooded brawler, huh?</i>

12:18.270 --> 12:24.090
<i>Having both flaming brutality
and ice-cold cunningness...</i>

12:24.720 --> 12:26.180
I concur.

12:26.640 --> 12:27.360
Baran!

12:27.360 --> 12:31.540
This new Hero possesses great potential.

12:27.470 --> 12:31.520
DRAGON LEGION LEGION COMMANDER
DRAGON MASTER GENERAL BARAN

12:31.540 --> 12:33.520
You made it.

12:34.350 --> 12:36.330
My sympathies, pal.

12:36.330 --> 12:42.190
Heading off to take Ringaia and then
being summoned right back.

12:43.400 --> 12:45.050
Your sympathies are unnecessary.

12:45.050 --> 12:47.800
I've already crushed Ringaia Kingdom.

12:47.800 --> 12:48.870
-What?!
-Really?!

12:49.740 --> 12:54.100
Lord Hadlar awaits
in the Left Shoulder Chamber. Come.

12:54.100 --> 12:59.020
He wiped out the Fortress Kingdom
of Ringaia in such a short time?!

12:59.020 --> 13:02.800
He's as powerful
as a wrathful god just as always.

13:03.550 --> 13:05.510
Thank you all for coming so far.

13:06.720 --> 13:11.160
<i>Hmm. I see Master Hadlar
has gained more power again.</i>

13:11.160 --> 13:14.690
<i>It's as though power oozes from him.</i>

13:16.060 --> 13:20.520
<i>It appears his seat as Dark Commander
remains secure for now.</i>

13:20.900 --> 13:23.440
That leaves Mystvearn and Hyunckel.

13:23.820 --> 13:27.490
Who the hell is late
for an emergency summons?

13:27.910 --> 13:33.040
Flazzard, didn't you notice
Mystvearn is already seated?

13:33.910 --> 13:36.750
SHADOW LEGION LEGION COMMANDER
MYSTVEARN, THE SHADOW VIZIER

13:34.660 --> 13:36.750
You?! When the hell...?!

13:37.710 --> 13:40.600
Always the unsociable one, I see.

13:40.600 --> 13:42.860
That leaves Hyunckel.

13:42.860 --> 13:47.720
Unfortunately, it appears
I must apologize to all of you.

13:48.260 --> 13:54.490
I intended to gather our forces
and crush the new Hero, Dai.

13:54.490 --> 14:00.060
But Dark King Vearn
has made a direct order.

14:00.520 --> 14:05.920
He gave the task
of slaying Dai to Hyunckel.

14:05.920 --> 14:07.740
What?!

14:09.200 --> 14:13.370
Is this really the famous
scenic port city of Papnica?!

14:13.700 --> 14:15.810
Captain, this place is dangerous!

14:15.810 --> 14:18.850
Once we're off the ship,
get away from here!

14:18.850 --> 14:22.600
Are you sure?
If he does that, our ride back...

14:22.600 --> 14:25.870
This isn't the time
to be worried about that!

14:25.870 --> 14:27.720
Hey, wait up, Dai!

14:31.890 --> 14:33.560
<i>Please be okay, Leona!</i>

14:42.860 --> 14:44.690
Leona!

14:48.450 --> 14:49.260
Dai...

14:49.260 --> 14:52.490
This is terrible. I doubt any survivors...

15:00.500 --> 15:01.980
S-S-S-Skeletons!

15:01.980 --> 15:04.170
This must be the immortal legion!

15:04.460 --> 15:06.420
They invaded this country!

15:07.970 --> 15:11.640
Calm down, Dai! We're clearly outnumbered!

15:13.550 --> 15:16.850
Oh, fine then.
It looks like we have to fight!

15:25.570 --> 15:26.610
Who is that?!

15:26.980 --> 15:30.210
That was Avan Style
Sword Technique Earth Slash!

15:30.210 --> 15:33.120
Then he's a Disciple of Avan, too?!

15:39.250 --> 15:42.640
I didn't know there were other users of
the Avan Style Sword Technique.

15:42.640 --> 15:46.050
If he's a Disciple of Avan,
I'm sure he'll join us!

15:46.420 --> 15:50.130
Are you sure?
He's got the face of a villain.

15:51.300 --> 15:53.180
Thank you for saving us!

15:53.930 --> 15:56.260
Are you a student of Avan, too?!

15:57.260 --> 15:58.600
Who are you?

16:03.350 --> 16:06.520
It's true that
I learned to fight from Avan.

16:06.940 --> 16:10.650
If I'm to be called a student of Avan,

16:11.400 --> 16:14.170
then I would be the first.

16:14.170 --> 16:16.300
Huh?! You're his first student?!

16:16.300 --> 16:17.200
Oh wow!

16:18.410 --> 16:20.180
<i>What a freaky sword.</i>

16:20.180 --> 16:23.540
<i>I've never seen a sword
so ominous and eerie.</i>

16:24.960 --> 16:27.770
<i>He's got a strange, malicious feel to him.</i>

16:27.770 --> 16:30.260
<i>Is he really on our side?</i>

16:30.670 --> 16:33.110
Tell us what happened to this country.

16:33.110 --> 16:37.030
It fell to the Undead Legion
of the Dark Army two days ago.

16:37.030 --> 16:39.870
The Undead Legion?!
You mean those skeletons?

16:39.870 --> 16:41.200
What about Leona?!

16:41.200 --> 16:43.690
Do you know what happened
to the princess of this country?

16:44.140 --> 16:47.820
No idea. I was wondering that myself.

16:48.400 --> 16:52.760
It's an outrage! Hyunckel?!
That little pipsqueak!

16:52.760 --> 16:58.140
I never liked the fact that
even though he's just a human,

16:58.140 --> 17:00.620
he was accepted as a Legion Commander!

17:01.750 --> 17:05.000
Calm down, Flazzard.
You're heating the place up.

17:05.290 --> 17:07.310
How am I supposed to calm down?!

17:07.310 --> 17:09.610
I understand your rage.

17:09.610 --> 17:14.400
But this was
our Dark King Vearn's decision.

17:14.400 --> 17:18.740
I'm sure the whole thing
was Hyunckel's idea!

17:18.740 --> 17:24.390
Just because the Dark King took a liking
to him, he gets all uppity! That brat...

17:26.940 --> 17:28.540
<i>Mystvearn...</i>

17:28.540 --> 17:34.380
<i>The shadow being who can remain silent
for decades at a time...</i>

17:34.380 --> 17:36.200
<i>He's laughing!</i>

17:37.360 --> 17:41.760
The Dark King's words
take precedence above all.

17:41.760 --> 17:43.500
Exactly.

17:43.870 --> 17:46.750
We have no choice but to obey.

17:47.460 --> 17:53.440
Besides, Hyunckel
is the perfect choice for killing Dai.

17:53.440 --> 17:56.570
Dai cannot defeat Hyunckel.

17:56.570 --> 17:58.550
After all...

17:59.140 --> 18:02.320
We were lucky to meet you here.

18:02.320 --> 18:05.240
Join us and fight with us.

18:05.240 --> 18:06.140
Hold it!

18:07.230 --> 18:09.190
Something's off here!

18:09.860 --> 18:11.460
What are you talking about, Popp?

18:11.460 --> 18:16.380
Yeah. Only a student of Master Avan
could use Earth Slash, right?

18:16.380 --> 18:17.920
If you're really a student of Avan,

18:17.920 --> 18:20.910
then you should have
an Insignia of Avan like us.

18:21.330 --> 18:23.370
An Insignia of Avan...

18:25.450 --> 18:27.020
He really has one!

18:27.020 --> 18:28.600
See?

18:28.600 --> 18:31.460
We need all the help we can get!

18:31.840 --> 18:34.880
Please, fight with us!

18:43.010 --> 18:44.350
What's so funny?

18:46.140 --> 18:50.660
I was just laughing
at what fools you all are.

18:50.660 --> 18:51.440
What?!

19:04.620 --> 19:05.950
What's the meaning of this?!

19:06.370 --> 19:09.000
I told you! He's a villain after all!

19:10.790 --> 19:12.520
But his Insignia of Avan...

19:12.520 --> 19:14.500
It's probably a fake!

19:16.260 --> 19:17.970
It's not fake.

19:18.760 --> 19:24.680
Not all students of Avan
respect their teacher and love justice.

19:25.100 --> 19:29.890
Some of them love violence
and have embraced the darkness.

19:30.310 --> 19:32.150
After seeing just how weak...

19:32.860 --> 19:34.290
justice really is!

19:34.290 --> 19:35.270
But...!

19:36.400 --> 19:37.740
I am Hyunckel!

19:38.940 --> 19:41.470
One of the Six Legion Commanders
of the Dark Army!

19:38.940 --> 19:44.160
UNDEAD LEGION LEGION COMMANDER
HYUNCKEL, THE DARK SWORDSMAN

19:41.470 --> 19:44.180
Hyunckel, the Undead Legion Commander!

19:44.180 --> 19:49.060
But... How could a student of Master Avan
be a Legion Commander of the Dark Army?!

19:49.060 --> 19:49.960
Dammit!

19:50.460 --> 19:51.170
Frizz!

19:52.170 --> 19:56.190
These are resurrected corpse warriors
who have surpassed death!

19:56.190 --> 19:59.210
They will not stop their advance
unless pulverized!

20:00.010 --> 20:03.200
Wait Hyunckel! Haven't you heard?!

20:03.200 --> 20:04.570
Master Avan...

20:04.570 --> 20:07.410
Master Avan was killed! By the Dark Army!

20:07.410 --> 20:09.520
Yes. I heard about it.

20:10.100 --> 20:12.020
I heard Hadlar killed him.

20:12.520 --> 20:15.190
And yet you still fight
for the Dark Army?!

20:16.070 --> 20:18.400
It was quite a shock.

20:19.820 --> 20:23.720
He was killed by an enemy
he once defeated!

20:23.720 --> 20:29.080
That's what he gets for taking on students
while neglecting his own training.

20:29.620 --> 20:33.080
I was hoping to kill him myself.

20:33.080 --> 20:35.270
Such a shame.

20:35.270 --> 20:41.190
I asked Vearn, the Dark King,
to let me wipe out his students,

20:41.190 --> 20:46.220
but to run into weaklings like you
is such a disappointment.

20:49.770 --> 20:51.270
Earth Slash...

20:51.640 --> 20:53.830
Don't disrespect Master Avan any more!

20:53.830 --> 20:57.020
I won't forgive anyone
who talks like that! Take it back!

20:57.310 --> 20:59.270
Oh? Interesting.

21:00.480 --> 21:03.070
And what if I say I won't?

21:03.450 --> 21:04.410
I'll do this!

21:05.860 --> 21:07.450
He blocked Earth Slash!

21:09.910 --> 21:14.220
Reexamine your skills
before your run your mouth, boy!

21:14.220 --> 21:14.790
Darn it!

21:16.330 --> 21:17.730
How about this?!

21:17.730 --> 21:20.630
Avan Style Sword Technique Wave Slash!

21:27.390 --> 21:31.560
Oh no! Hyunckel's sword beats Dai's
in both strength and skill!

21:35.980 --> 21:39.320
I know all about
the Avan Style Sword Technique.

21:39.690 --> 21:42.990
Dodging someone of your skill is easy.

21:43.530 --> 21:44.420
It's not over!

21:44.420 --> 21:45.450
That stance...!

21:45.700 --> 21:47.070
Avan Strash!

22:20.150 --> 22:25.900
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:20.150 --> 22:25.900
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:26.070 --> 22:32.910
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:26.070 --> 22:32.910
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:33.080 --> 22:36.120
<i>doudarou</i>

22:33.080 --> 22:36.120
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:38.420 --> 22:44.090
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:38.420 --> 22:44.090
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:44.250 --> 22:46.630
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:44.250 --> 22:46.630
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:46.800 --> 22:52.760
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:46.800 --> 22:52.760
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:53.220 --> 22:57.430
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:53.220 --> 22:57.430
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:57.600 --> 23:01.650
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

22:57.600 --> 23:01.650
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

23:01.810 --> 23:08.110
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:01.810 --> 23:08.110
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:13.950
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:13.950
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:14.120 --> 23:19.250
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:14.120 --> 23:19.250
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:34.180 --> 23:36.970
<i>Dai's Avan Strash had no effect.</i>

23:37.140 --> 23:40.940
<i>Hyunckel dons the ultimate armour
and fights with his Dark Sword.</i>

23:41.400 --> 23:45.070
<i>His heart overflows with intense hatred.</i>

23:45.230 --> 23:48.490
<i>Eventually, Avan and Hyunckel's past
is revealed.</i>

23:48.650 --> 23:52.070
<i>Can Dai defeat Hyunckel?</i>

23:52.610 --> 23:55.870
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:56.040 --> 23:58.080
<i>"Hyunckel, the Dark Swordsman"</i>

23:58.250 --> 24:00.210
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

24:00.210 --> 24:00.210


24:00.210 --> 24:02.210

